        <p class="section-note">
          Six named tokens carry the brand, and they're used well where they're used at all — but
          only 46 <code>var()</code> references exist across 2,772 lines of CSS, against
          <strong>57 distinct hex values</strong>. Most of the rest is imported palette: Material
          Design and Bootstrap defaults that arrived one button at a time.
        </p>

        <h3>Named tokens — the real palette</h3>
