          <code>packages/design-tokens/tokens.css</code> (<code>@fleet/design-tokens</code>), served
          here at <code>/fleet/tokens.css</code> and imported by the Tabletop through Vite — one
          dictionary, both ships. They are deliberately <em>not</em> mirrored in
          <code>styles.css</code>, which now holds only <code>--background-color</code>. Add or change
          a shared token in the package; never re-declare one in a ship's own <code>:root</code>.
          The package holds four non-colour tokens too, shown where they belong rather than as
          swatches: <code>--font-chrome</code>, <code>--font-content</code> and
          <code>--font-display</code> under <a href="#type">Typography</a>, and
          <code>--radius-soft</code> under <a href="#geometry">Geometry</a>.
